column156:
2 things; 
1) Experience something new in the Tech industry (TikTok fastest growing). 
2) Learning about sales skills

Exited via mutual transition; moving to FleetCorp in a director of global strategy role - good mix of corp strategy and good bit of m&a, more sustainable, one of the vps in their m&a group just left so he will pick that up.  sounds like their goal is to be more involved in M&A so Collin's background was interesting to them. 
wont have a direct team to start, IC role with dotted line to someone
primarily in person/in office expectations;
